{"title":"Career Roadmap · Research Analyst","role":"Research Analyst","summary":"A Research Analyst collects, cleans, analyses and interprets information to answer business, economic, financial, policy or market questions. A BA Economics degree is a strong foundation because it develops economic reasoning, statistics, quantitative analysis, research methodology and understanding of markets and policy.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The title is broad, so the student's eventual specialisation matters. A BA Economics graduate can target Economic Research, Market Research, Business Research, Policy Research, Financial Research or Data/Research Analyst roles."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"A BA Economics graduate can enter junior research and analyst roles, but more quantitative economics positions often prefer an MA/MSc Economics, Statistics, Econometrics, Data Science or Finance. Building strong statistics, Excel, SQL and Python skills during the bachelor's degree can substantially improve employability."}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Primary function"},{"text":"Research, analysis and evidence-based insights"}],[{"text":"Degree alignment"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Core disciplines"},{"text":"Economics, statistics, econometrics, research methodology"}],[{"text":"Entry level"},{"text":"Research Analyst / Research Associate / Junior Analyst"}],[{"text":"Related roles"},{"text":"Economic Research Analyst, Market Research Analyst, Business Research Analyst"}],[{"text":"Work environments"},{"text":"Consulting, research firms, banks, financial institutions, think tanks, corporates"}],[{"text":"Key strengths"},{"text":"Analytical thinking, quantitative skills, research and communication"}],[{"text":"Long-term potential"},{"text":"Senior Analyst → Research Lead → Research Manager / Economist / Strategy roles"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Research Analyst Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Research Analyst typically follows a process such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Research question"},{"type":"h","text":"Define methodology"},{"type":"h","text":"Collect data"},{"type":"h","text":"Clean data"},{"type":"h","text":"Analyse"},{"type":"h","text":"Interpret"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop insights"},{"type":"h","text":"Prepare report"},{"type":"h","text":"Present recommendations"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collecting economic or business data"},{"text":"Conducting secondary research"},{"text":"Analysing datasets"},{"text":"Tracking market trends"},{"text":"Building economic indicators"},{"text":"Conducting surveys"},{"text":"Performing statistical analysis"},{"text":"Creating charts and dashboards"},{"text":"Analysing company/industry information"},{"text":"Preparing research reports"},{"text":"Monitoring competitors"},{"text":"Conducting literature reviews"},{"text":"Supporting senior analysts/economists"},{"text":"Presenting findings to stakeholders"}]}]},{"heading":"Choose Your Research Track","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"\"Research Analyst\" is a broad career. During the degree, students should ideally select a direction."},{"type":"table","header":["Track","Typical Work"],"rows":[[{"text":"Economic Research"},{"text":"GDP, inflation, employment, trade, policy"}],[{"text":"Market Research"},{"text":"Consumers, markets, competitors, demand"}],[{"text":"Business Research"},{"text":"Industries, companies, strategy"}],[{"text":"Financial Research"},{"text":"Companies, securities, markets, valuation"}],[{"text":"Policy Research"},{"text":"Public policy, development, government programmes"}],[{"text":"Data/Research Analytics"},{"text":"Statistical analysis and dashboards"}],[{"text":"Consulting Research"},{"text":"Industry and business research"}],[{"text":"Social Research"},{"text":"Surveys, demographics, social programmes"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A student does not need to permanently decide in Year 1, but by Year 3 a specialisation helps."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During Your Degree","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Economics & Quantitative Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals."},{"type":"h","text":"Economics"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microeconomics"},{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Economic systems"},{"text":"Market structures"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Production"},{"text":"Inflation"},{"text":"Unemployment"},{"text":"Monetary policy"},{"text":"Fiscal policy"},{"text":"International trade"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Algebra"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Calculus basics"},{"text":"Matrices"},{"text":"Optimisation"},{"text":"Mathematical reasoning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Correlation"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Statistics & Econometrics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a critical stage."},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"ANOVA"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Statistical significance"},{"text":"Experimental design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Econometrics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Simple regression"},{"text":"Multiple regression"},{"text":"OLS"},{"text":"Multicollinearity"},{"text":"Heteroskedasticity"},{"text":"Autocorrelation"},{"text":"Dummy variables"},{"text":"Time-series basics"},{"text":"Panel-data concepts"},{"text":"Model interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn at least one statistical programming environment:"},{"type":"h","text":"Python or R"},{"type":"p","text":"Ideally:"},{"type":"h","text":"Python + R"}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Research & Data Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Move from classroom theory to real-world analysis."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Survey design"},{"text":"Questionnaire design"},{"text":"Data collection"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Secondary research"},{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Report writing"},{"text":"Citation and referencing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python/pandas"},{"text":"R"},{"text":"Jupyter Notebook"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Specialisation & Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the programme is four years, focus on becoming job-ready."},{"type":"h","text":"Choose a specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Economics + Data"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Economics + Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Economics + Public Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Economics + Market Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Build a research portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Create 4–6 strong projects demonstrating:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research question"},{"text":"Data sources"},{"text":"Methodology"},{"text":"Analysis"},{"text":"Visualisation"},{"text":"Findings"},{"text":"Limitations"},{"text":"Recommendations"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Economics + mathematics"},{"text":"Micro, macro, statistics fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Regression, hypothesis testing, R/Python"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Research & analytics"},{"text":"SQL, Excel, Power BI, research methodology"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Advanced projects, internships, portfolio"}]]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Inflation Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Research:"},{"type":"p","text":"How has inflation affected household expenditure?"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CPI"},{"text":"Food inflation"},{"text":"Fuel inflation"},{"text":"Housing"},{"text":"Income"},{"text":"Consumption"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python/R","Excel","Power BI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Statistical interpretation"},{"text":"Visualisations"},{"text":"Conclusions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Unemployment Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unemployment trends"},{"text":"Youth unemployment"},{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Gender"},{"text":"Region"},{"text":"Labour participation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dashboard showing trends over time."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Economic Growth Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GDP"},{"text":"Sectoral growth"},{"text":"Investment"},{"text":"Consumption"},{"text":"Exports"},{"text":"Imports"},{"text":"Employment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Compare several years and explain major changes."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Market Research Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a product category."},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Survey"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Questionnaire"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Regression/correlation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce a professional market research report."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Industry Research Report"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose an industry such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"IT"},{"text":"Automotive"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market size"},{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"Major companies"},{"text":"Competition"},{"text":"Demand drivers"},{"text":"Risks"},{"text":"Future outlook"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is excellent preparation for business research and consulting."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Econometric Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a research question such as:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"What factors influence household consumption?\""},{"type":"p","text":"Variables could include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income"},{"text":"Household size"},{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Employment"},{"text":"Inflation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a regression model and explain the results."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships are highly valuable for analyst roles."},{"type":"h","text":"Target employers"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research firms"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Financial institutions"},{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Economic research organisations"},{"text":"Market research companies"},{"text":"Investment research firms"},{"text":"Government research institutions"},{"text":"Policy organisations"},{"text":"Data/analytics companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful internship titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research Intern"},{"text":"Economic Research Intern"},{"text":"Market Research Intern"},{"text":"Business Research Intern"},{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Policy Research Intern"},{"text":"Investment Research Intern"},{"text":"Consulting Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"What to Learn During an Internship","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Try to gain experience in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data collection"},{"text":"Excel analysis"},{"text":"Secondary research"},{"text":"Industry research"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Survey analysis"},{"text":"Report writing"},{"text":"PowerPoint presentations"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Client research"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective should be:"},{"type":"h","text":"“I can take an ambiguous research question and turn it into a structured analysis.”"}]},{"heading":"Tools to Master","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Excel — Essential"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power Pivot"},{"text":"Advanced formulas"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Charts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL — Highly Valuable"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python fundamentals"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"seaborn"},{"text":"SciPy"},{"text":"statsmodels"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"R"},{"type":"p","text":"Particularly useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Academic research"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"tidyverse"},{"text":"ggplot2"},{"text":"dplyr"},{"text":"statistical modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Interactive dashboards"},{"text":"KPI design"},{"text":"Time-series analysis"}]}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Be Hired For","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After a BA Economics, realistic entry-level roles include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Research Analyst"},{"text":"Research Associate"},{"text":"Research Executive"},{"text":"Research Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Economics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Economic Research Assistant"},{"text":"Junior Economic Analyst"},{"text":"Economics Analyst — Junior"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Market Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market Research Analyst"},{"text":"Market Research Executive"},{"text":"Consumer Insights Analyst"},{"text":"Research Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Research Analyst"},{"text":"Business Analyst — Research"},{"text":"Industry Research Analyst"},{"text":"Competitive Intelligence Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"p","text":"With stronger technical skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Data Analyst"},{"text":"Research Data Analyst"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Analyst — Junior"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"With finance skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equity Research Associate — Junior"},{"text":"Financial Research Analyst"},{"text":"Credit Research Analyst"},{"text":"Investment Research Analyst"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Some finance research roles may have additional regulatory, certification or employer-specific requirements."}]},{"heading":"Employer-Ready Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"R"},{"text":"Working/Strong"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Report writing"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Industry research"},{"text":"Strong"}],[{"text":"Critical thinking"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"Portfolio"},{"text":"Essential"}]]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not mandatory for every Research Analyst role, but it can significantly improve access to economist, policy, quantitative and research-intensive positions."},{"type":"h","text":"M.A./M.Sc. Economics"},{"type":"p","text":"One of the strongest options."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Economic research"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Policy analysis"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Development economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc. Econometrics / Quantitative Economics"},{"type":"p","text":"Excellent for students interested in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Econometric modelling"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Quantitative research"},{"text":"Data-heavy economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc. Statistics / Data Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research analytics"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Statistical modelling"},{"text":"Business analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business research"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Market intelligence"},{"text":"Business analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial research"},{"text":"Investment research"},{"text":"Corporate research"},{"text":"Equity/credit research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.A. Public Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Strong for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government research"},{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Policy consulting"},{"text":"Development sector"}]}]},{"heading":"Best PG Path by Career Goal","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Goal","Recommended PG"],"rows":[[{"text":"Economist"},{"text":"MA/MSc Economics"}],[{"text":"Economic Research"},{"text":"MA/MSc Economics / Econometrics"}],[{"text":"Quantitative Research"},{"text":"Econometrics / Statistics / Data Science"}],[{"text":"Market Research"},{"text":"MBA Marketing / Market Research / Analytics"}],[{"text":"Business Research"},{"text":"MBA Business Analytics / Strategy"}],[{"text":"Financial Research"},{"text":"MBA Finance / MSc Finance"}],[{"text":"Policy Research"},{"text":"MA Public Policy / Economics"}],[{"text":"Data Research"},{"text":"MSc Data Science / Statistics"}],[{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"MBA / Economics / Analytics"}]]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Applied Economics"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Public Policy"},{"text":"Development Economics"},{"text":"Financial Economics"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Market Research"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong international profile usually combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Economics","Quantitative Methods","Programming","Research"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A typical path:"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Economics"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Analyst / Research Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Research Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Lead / Senior Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Director / Head of Research"}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Economist","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Economics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Assistant","MA/MSc Economics","Economic Analyst","Economist","Senior Economist","Economic Research Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate economics qualification is generally important for serious economist-track roles."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Policy Research","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Economics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Policy Research Intern","Research Assistant","Policy Analyst","Senior Policy Analyst","Policy Research Manager","Policy/Strategy Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"Recommended additions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public policy"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Survey research"},{"text":"Programme evaluation"},{"text":"Impact evaluation"}]}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Market Research","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Economics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Market Research Executive","Research Analyst","Consumer Insights Analyst","Senior Analyst","Insights Manager","Research Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Survey design"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Presentation"}]}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Financial Research","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Economics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Financial Research Intern","Junior Research Analyst","Equity/Credit Research Analyst","Senior Analyst","Research Associate/Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Capital markets"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Professional certifications may be useful depending on the specific finance career path."}]},{"heading":"AI & Future Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is changing research work substantially."},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature searches"},{"text":"Document summarisation"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Coding"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Report drafting"},{"text":"Competitor research"},{"text":"Market monitoring"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, researchers still need to validate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Sources"},{"text":"Methodology"},{"text":"Statistical assumptions"},{"text":"Causal claims"},{"text":"Model outputs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI can generate a convincing answer that is economically or statistically wrong."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore:"},{"type":"p","text":"AI accelerates research; it does not replace research judgement."}]},{"heading":"AI-Era Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future Research Analyst profile combines:"},{"type":"h","text":"Economics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microeconomics"},{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Policy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"R"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Survey methodology"},{"text":"Causal reasoning"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Report writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI-assisted research"},{"text":"Prompt design"},{"text":"Automated data workflows"},{"text":"LLM evaluation"},{"text":"Research verification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Executive presentations"},{"text":"Research writing"},{"text":"Visualisation"}]}]},{"heading":"AI + Economics Specialisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A particularly strong modern pathway is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Economics"},{"type":"h","text":"Econometrics"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"p","text":"This can lead toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Economic Data Analyst"},{"text":"Quantitative Research Analyst"},{"text":"Policy Data Analyst"},{"text":"Economic Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Research Data Analyst"},{"text":"Forecasting Analyst"}]}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong BA Economics graduate should be able to say:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I can frame a research question, identify appropriate data sources, clean and analyse data using Excel, SQL and Python/R, apply statistical and econometric methods, interpret results correctly, build clear dashboards and communicate evidence-based conclusions.”"},{"type":"p","text":"That is much stronger than simply saying:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I studied Economics and know basic statistics.”"}]},{"heading":"Portfolio You Should Have Before Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Ideally:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Economic analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Inflation / GDP / unemployment study"},{"type":"h","text":"2. Econometrics"},{"type":"h","text":"Regression-based research project"},{"type":"h","text":"3. Market research"},{"type":"h","text":"Survey + consumer analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"4. Industry research"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional industry report"},{"type":"h","text":"5. Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI economic/business dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"6. Data project"},{"type":"h","text":"Python + SQL research analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"A GitHub or professional portfolio can contain the code, methodology and visualisations where appropriate."}]},{"heading":"Best Practical Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Economics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Master micro + macro economics","Build mathematics + statistics","Learn econometrics","Become advanced in Excel","Learn SQL","Learn Python + pandas + statsmodels","Learn R if targeting economics/academic research","Learn Power BI","Complete a research internship","Build 4–6 research projects","Learn professional report writing","Apply for:"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Analyst / Research Associate / Economic Research Assistant / Market Research Analyst / Business Research Analyst","Gain 1–3 years of experience","Choose a specialisation:"]},{"type":"h","text":"Economic Research / Policy / Market Research / Finance / Data Analytics / Consulting"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pursue MA/MSc Economics, Econometrics, Statistics, Data Science, Public Policy or MBA where it supports the chosen path","Progress toward:"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Senior Research Analyst","Research Lead","Research Manager","Research Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best AI-era combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Economics","Econometrics","Statistics","SQL","Python/R","Power BI","Research Methodology","AI Literacy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the biggest employability advantage comes from converting a traditionally theory-heavy BA Economics profile into a quantitative research profile with demonstrable data analysis, econometrics and research projects."}]}]}